   **`src/lib/core/setGameResult/setGameResult.ts`** (rewritten):
   - `mapWinnerToPoints` → `winnerToStatus(winner): GameDayStatus` (A→AWin, B→BWin, draw→Draw, else→Scheduled).
   - `updateTeamOutcomes` → `chargeTeamOutcomes(gameDay, team, deps)` — dropped the `outcomeService.upsert` calls entirely (points no longer stored); only charges via `transactionService.charge`.
   - `SetGameResultDeps.outcomeService` narrowed from `Pick<..., 'getByGameDay' | 'upsert'>` to `Pick<..., 'getByGameDay'>`.
   - `setGameResultCore`: `gameDayService.update({ id, bibs, status: winnerToStatus(data.winner) })` (single write replaces the old bibs-only update + two `updateTeamOutcomes` points-writing calls); charges via `Promise.all([chargeTeamOutcomes(gameDay,'A',deps), chargeTeamOutcomes(gameDay,'B',deps)])`.
   - Updated JSDoc for both the module and the main function.

   **`src/lib/core/setGameEnabled/setGameEnabled.ts`**: `gameDayService.update({ id, game: data.game, comment: data.reason })` → `{ id, status: data.game ? 'Scheduled' : 'NoGame', comment: data.reason }`. Kept `SetGameEnabledInput.game: z.boolean()` action-input shape unchanged (deliberate design decision per plan).

   **`src/lib/core/createMoreGameDays/createMoreGameDays.ts`**: `gameDayService.create({..., game: row.game, ...})` → `{..., status: row.game ? 'Scheduled' : 'NoGame', ...}`.

   **`src/lib/core/updateInvoiceGameDays/updateInvoiceGameDays.ts`**: `gameDayService.update({ id: gd.id, game: gd.gameScheduled })` → `{ id: gd.id, status: gd.gameScheduled ? 'Scheduled' : 'NoGame' }`.

   **Components**:
   - `src/components/GameDayIndicator/GameDayIndicator.tsx`: `gameDay.game === false` → `gameDay.status === 'NoGame'` (guarding the same mailSent split).
   - `src/components/GameDaySummary/GameDaySummary.tsx`: import changed to `{ getGameWinnerFromStatus, getTeamResultState, isGame }`; `winner = getGameWinnersFromTeams(teamA, teamB)` → `getGameWinnerFromStatus(gameDay.status)`; `noGame = gameDay.game ? '' : 'No game'` → `isGame(gameDay.status) ? '' : 'No game'`; two `gameDay.game` conditionals → `isGame(gameDay.status)`.
   - `src/components/PickerForm/PickerForm.tsx`: added `import { isGame } from '@/lib/gameResult';`; `game: !gameDay.game` → `game: !isGame(gameDay.status)`; all UI conditionals (`gameDay.game ? ... : ...` for title, aria-label, placeholder, color, button text) → `isGame(gameDay.status)`.
   - `src/components/PlayerHeatmap/PlayerHeatmap.tsx`: `noGame: entry.gameDay!.game === false` → `entry.gameDay!.status === 'NoGame'`; updated two doc comments referencing `gameDay.game`/`game: true` to reference `status`.
   - `src/app/footy/admin/invoice/page.tsx`: added `import { isGame } from '@/lib/gameResult';`; `gameScheduled: gd.game || gd.mailSent !== null` → `gameScheduled: isGame(gd.status) || gd.mailSent !== null`.

   **`src/lib/importlivedb/importlivedb.ts`** (found via later repo-wide grep, not part of original inventory pass): `where: { gameDay: { game: true } }` → `where: { gameDay: { status: { not: 'NoGame' } } }` (in `reconcilePlayerJoinedFinishedDates`).

   **`prisma/refresh-upcoming-gameday.ts`** (also found via later grep): `where: { game: true, mailSent: null }` → `where: { status: { not: 'NoGame' }, mailSent: null }`.

   **`prisma/seed.ci.ts`**: added `GameDayStatus` to the `prisma/generated/client` import; the `gameDays` array's type changed `game: boolean` → `status: GameDayStatus`; moved the win/draw/loss `result`/`status` computation from the outcomes-loop into the historical-gameDays-creation while-loop (since status must be known at `createMany` time, not decided later); `upcomingGame.status = GameDayStatus.Scheduled`; the `outcomes` array type and push calls both dropped the `points`/`aPoints`/`bPoints` fields entirely (team assignment is now sufficient).

   **`docs/ontology.yaml`**:
