   - `GameDay.description` and `keyAttributes.game` → `keyAttributes.status` (long description referencing the new derivation and pointing to `rules.cancelled-game`).
   - `Outcome.keyAttributes.points` rewritten to describe it as derived/non-stored.
   - `processes.matchResult.steps` rewritten (5 steps, status-based, no per-outcome writes, references `getGameWinnerFromStatus`/`getPlayerPoints`).
   - `processes.pickerAlgorithm` step updated to describe derivation via `getPlayerPoints` instead of raw `Outcome.points`.
   - `rules.unanimous-team-points` replaced with `rules.cancelled-game` (documents `status===NoGame && mailSent!==null`, sourced to `GameDay.getGamesCancelled`, `Outcome.getTurnout`, `GameDayIndicator.tsx`).
   - Validated as syntactically valid YAML via a node one-liner (`require('yaml')`/`js-yaml`).

   **Test files fixed directly by me** (not via fork): `src/lib/gameResult.vitest.spec.ts`, `src/lib/core/setGameResult/setGameResult.vitest.spec.ts` (full rewrite), `src/lib/core/setGameEnabled/setGameEnabled.vitest.spec.ts`, `src/components/GameDayIndicator/GameDayIndicator.vitest.spec.tsx` + `.stories.tsx`, `src/components/GameDaySummary/GameDaySummary.vitest.spec.tsx`, `src/components/PickerForm/PickerForm.vitest.spec.tsx` + `.stories.tsx`, `src/components/PlayerForm/PlayerForm.vitest.spec.tsx`, `src/components/PlayerHeatmap/PlayerHeatmap.vitest.spec.tsx`, `src/app/footy/game/[id]/page.vitest.spec.ts`, `src/app/footy/(authenticated)/downloadmydata/page.vitest.spec.ts`, `src/lib/core/createMoreGameDays/createMoreGameDays.vitest.spec.ts`, `src/lib/core/updateInvoiceGameDays/updateInvoiceGameDays.vitest.spec.ts`, `src/app/footy/admin/invoice/page.vitest.spec.tsx` (fixed `makeGameDay` helper's hand-written type), `src/lib/core/submitGameInvitationResponse/submitGameInvitationResponse.vitest.spec.ts`, `src/lib/core/submitResponse/submitResponse.vitest.spec.ts`, `src/lib/core/submitPicker/submitPicker.vitest.spec.ts`, `src/actions/setGameEnabled.vitest.spec.ts`.

