   - **Full storybook suite (`npx vitest run`) surfaced 2 timeouts**: `WinnersTable.stories.tsx` and `YearTable.stories.tsx`, both `Test timed out in 15000ms`. Verified neither file references game/points/GameDay/Outcome fields at all (WinnersTable's only "points" hit is the unrelated `TableName` enum value `'points'`). Re-ran both files in isolation: both passed in ~5s total. Concluded this was a resource-starvation flake from running 82 storybook/browser-mode tests in parallel, pre-existing and unrelated to this refactor — not fixed (nothing to fix), but explicitly verified as non-regressing.
