559	/**
560	 * Returns a player-records map seeded from the most-recent DB row per player
561	 * for the given year before `beforeGameDayId`. Only writable fields are kept
562	 * (i.e. `id` is stripped via `PlayerRecordWriteInputSchema`) so the map is
563	 * safe to pass directly to `calculateYearPlayerRecords`.
